<%# The week as rows with `preferences: :local`: the panel ends in a
    Preferences item, the dialog it opens is drawn (closed) beside the toolbar,
    and the root carries the URL of every set the dialog can save — here each
    one a `density` URL, so saving lands on that preview drawing it. `density`
    is where to try it; this exists so the snapshot and the audit cover the
    dialog's markup, which `density`, a method, would not give them. %>
<%= render(Shadcn::EventCalendar::Component.new(
      reading: :weekly,
      arrangement: :rows,
      month: Date.new(2026, 8, 1),
      selected: Date.new(2026, 8, 5),
      events: Shadcn::EventCalendar::Preview.workload_events,
      preferences: :local,
      preferences_url: lambda { |set|
        "/lookbook/preview/shadcn/event_calendar/density?#{set.merge(preferences: :local).to_query}"
      }
    )) %>
